sequenceDiagram
    title BLE Central Complete Flow: Scan, Connect, Pair

    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral


    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. CurrentState).

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 1. Configuration (optional)
        opt App overrides the default security profile
            App->>Node: GapCentral.SetSecurityMode(<br>mode=mode1, level=authenticatedPairing)
            App->>Node: GapCentral.SetIoCapabilities(displayYesNo)
        end
        Note over App: If skipped, the Node uses the platform defaults configured at build time.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 2. Discovery
        opt App narrows the scan
            App->>Node: GapCentral.SetDeviceDiscoveryFilter(<br>filter=address, data=C4:AB:12:34:56:78)
        end
        App->>Node: GapCentral.StartDeviceDiscovery()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(scanning)

        loop Until target peripheral is found
            Peripheral-)Node: Advertisement / scan response
            Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.DeviceDiscovered(<br>addressWithType={address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress},<br>rssi=-38, advertisingReportType=advInd)
        end

        App->>Node: GapCentral.Standby()
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 3. Connection
        App->>Node: GapCentral.Connect(<br>addressWithType={address=C4:AB:12:34:56:78, addressType=randomAddress},<br>initiatingTimeoutInMs=5000)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(initiating)
        Node-)Peripheral: CONNECT_IND (unacknowledged)
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: Typical first LL activity after CONNECT_IND
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_FEATURE_REQ
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_FEATURE_RSP
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_VERSION_IND
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_VERSION_IND
            Note over Node, Peripheral: Empty data PDUs in both directions establish<br>the first bidirectional connection event.
        end
        Note over Node, Peripheral: Central enters the connection state<br>on send.<br>Link is confirmed by the first<br>bidirectional data exchange<br>in a connection event.
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(connected)
        Note over App, Node: The exact moment CurrentState(connected) fires is stack-dependent:<br>some stacks emit it on CONNECT_IND transmit,<br>others wait for the first successful data exchange.
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 4. Pairing and bonding
        App->>Node: GapCentral.PairAndBond()
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: SMP starts (LESC with MITM)
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Request (MITM requested)
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Response (MITM requested)
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Public_Key
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Public_Key
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Confirm
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_Random
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_Random
        end
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.AuthenticationRequired(<br>isNumericComparison=true, passkey=485923)

        Note over App: User confirms numeric comparison or enters passkey

        App->>Node: GapCentral.NumericComparisonConfirm(true)
        rect rgb(245, 240, 230)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: SMP completes and link is encrypted
            Node-)Peripheral: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Peripheral-)Node: Pairing_DHKey_Check
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_ENC_REQ
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_ENC_RSP
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_REQ (encrypted)
            Node-)Peripheral: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_START_ENC_RSP (encrypted)
            Note over Node, Peripheral: Key distribution (encrypted)
            Peripheral-)Node: Identity_Information (IRK)
            Peripheral-)Node: Identity_Address_Information
            Peripheral-)Node: Signing_Information (CSRK)
        end
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.NumberOfBondsChanged(1)
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.PairingResult(pairedSuccessfully=true)
    end

    rect rgb(230, 230, 240)
        note over App, Peripheral: 5. Disconnection
        rect rgb(245, 230, 230)
            Peripheral-)Node: LL_TERMINATE_IND
        end
        Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
        Note over App: App can also initiate the disconnect via GapCentral.Standby().<br>Reconnect to the same bonded peripheral via<br>BLE Central Bonded Reconnection.
    end
